 "narration": [
  {
   "text": "Everything begins... with a question.",
   "at": [
    1,
    1
   ],
   "file": "voice/00.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Behind the magic... there is only mathematics.",
   "at": [
    3,
    1
   ],
   "file": "voice/01.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Once, a machine could only follow instructions.",
   "at": [
    5,
    1
   ],
   "file": "voice/02.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then we taught it... to learn.",
   "at": [
    7,
    1
   ],
   "file": "voice/03.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Layer by layer... it began to understand.",
   "at": [
    9,
    1
   ],
   "file": "voice/04.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now it can paint.",
   "at": [
    13,
    0
   ],
   "file": "voice/05.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Compose.",
   "at": [
    14,
    0
   ],
   "file": "voice/06.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Discover.",
   "at": [
    15,
    0
   ],
   "file": "voice/07.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heal.",
   "at": [
    16,
    0
   ],
   "file": "voice/08.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "And build... whole worlds.",
   "at": [
    17,
    0
   ],
   "file": "voice/09.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "But for all it can do... it wants nothing of its own.",
   "at": [
    21,
    1
   ],
   "file": "voice/10.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "It waits... for a question.",
   "at": [
    24,
    1
   ],
   "file": "voice/11.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Somebody has to wonder first.",
   "at": [
    26,
    0.5
   ],
   "file": "voice/12.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Somebody has to dare.",
   "at": [
    27,
    1.5
   ],
   "file": "voice/13.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "The machine will follow you... anywhere.",
   "at": [
    29,
    1
   ],
   "file": "voice/14.mp3"
  },
  {
   "text": "But only as far as you can imagine.",
   "at": [
